 * hand-edit. Byte-serialised instruction stream of the P-table SSE builder
 * (state+0x6898, 7x256 bytes) inside SignState::sign at 0x17a1381-0x17a20b5,
 * plus the 46 16-byte .rodata const vectors it consumes. The P region is
 * INPUT-DEPENDENT: five body-derived bytes (st[a]^st[b] pairs read by the RM/XRM
 * ops) select one of 256 variants per variable table — the old frozen pTable
